  "title": "Uniform attachment with freezing: equivalence in law of the forward and reversed constructions",
  "abstract": "Lean proof that the forward uniform-attachment/freezing construction and the reversed growth-coalescent construction give the same distribution of labelled rooted trees, after the prescribed erasure of active reverse labels. The equality includes the extinction endpoint. It is stated on a canonical encoding that retains the complete graph and relevant labels. The dictionary to literal isomorphism-class language is mathematically reviewed but is not an additional Lean quotient-law equivalence theorem. This entry covers T05 and shares its proof repository with the companion asymptotic and SIR entries.",
